    "| `GraphSketchThresholding.hpp`| EWMA-based adaptive thresholding                           |\n",
    "| `GraphSketchFiltering.hpp`   | (Optional) Edge filtering logic                            |\n",
    "| `GraphSketchCore.hpp`        | Main pipeline to connect sketches and scores               |\n",
